<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>

  <main id="main-content" class="page">
    <h1>Rockpool Explorer</h1>
    <p class="section-lead">
      When the tide goes out, the animals of the shore hide from the sun under rocks and
      seaweed. Lift each rock to find out who is sheltering underneath. How many you can
      find depends on the tide, come back at a different time of day and the pool
      will have changed.
    </p>

    <div class="rockpool" data-rockpool>

      <div class="tide" data-tide>
        <p class="tide__label">
          <span class="tide__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <strong data-tide-label></strong>
        </p>
        <p class="tide__note" data-tide-note></p>
      </div>

      <div class="rockpool__bar">
        <p class="rockpool__score">
          Found <strong data-found-count>0</strong> of <strong data-total-count>8</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="rockpool__actions">
          <button type="button" class="filter__button" data-tide-cycle>See another tide</button>
          <button type="button" class="filter__button" data-rockpool-reset>Start again</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="rockpool__status" role="status" data-rockpool-status></p>

      <div class="rockpool__grid" data-rockpool-grid role="group" aria-label="Rockpool. Choose a rock to lift it.">
        <!-- Rocks are generated by JavaScript so the shuffle happens client-side -->
      </div>

      <div class="rockpool__found" data-rockpool-found hidden>
        <h2>What you have found</h2>
        <ul class="rockpool__list" data-rockpool-list></ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <aside class="rockpool__note">
      <h2>Doing this for real</h2>
      <p>
        If you go rockpooling on a real shore, always put rocks back exactly as you found
        them. The animals underneath rely on that shelter to survive until the tide returns.
        Our team runs Rockpool Ranger sessions at weekends, where you can learn how to
        explore a pool without harming anything that lives in it.
      </p>
      <p><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/zones/rockpools">Visit the Coastal Rockpools zone</a></p>
    </aside>

  </main>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>